title Cassette Bluetooth (T4, synthetic names): the recorder idle with the headset as input: the meter label reads BT instead of IN (same font, size and place); no CARD stepper
sizes 320x480 480x320 480x800 640x480 800x480 480x480 720x720
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BT rec
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect text "BT"
expect text "SOFT"
shot rec-bt-label
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
